WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:03.711
Suppose an analyst asks whether an effect they saw before

00:00:03.711 --> 00:00:05.512
will hold in the next experiment.

00:00:06.145 --> 00:00:10.317
ExperimentWiki grades the evidence behind each prediction.

00:00:10.604 --> 00:00:14.338
In later experiments, high-confidence predictions kept their direction

00:00:14.508 --> 00:00:16.889
more often than preliminary ones.

00:00:17.936 --> 00:00:20.617
To build the wiki, programs read the results

00:00:20.617 --> 00:00:25.240
of 4,386 past A/B experiments.

00:00:25.853 --> 00:00:30.554
They calculate the statistics and write pages that link related metrics.

00:00:30.879 --> 00:00:32.293
When someone asks a question,

00:00:32.554 --> 00:00:36.082
the agent reads the pages before giving advice.

00:00:37.145 --> 00:00:38.830
Why do the calculations first?

00:00:39.116 --> 00:00:42.609
In a blind writing test, the model made causal claims

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.771
before seeing the computed results.

00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:49.799
Forty-six percent of the checkable claims had the direction backwards.

00:00:50.124 --> 00:00:52.930
Once the model saw the computed evidence,

00:00:53.049 --> 00:00:56.796
147 out of 150 claims held.

00:00:57.853 --> 00:00:59.383
The harder test comes later.

00:00:59.709 --> 00:01:02.966
The team graded predictions using earlier experiments,

00:01:03.278 --> 00:01:06.136
then checked whether their directions held in new ones.

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:11.019
The direction held for 81 percent of high-confidence findings,

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:13.867
70 percent of evidence-grade findings,

00:01:14.025 --> 00:01:17.115
and 53 percent of preliminary findings.

00:01:18.199 --> 00:01:21.431
The system also checks how its own answers were produced.

00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:27.436
An audit ran 318 checks and opened 149 tickets.

00:01:28.074 --> 00:01:30.365
The team tried 28 fixes.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.368
Nineteen were kept, and nine were rejected.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:35.829
New experiments test the knowledge.

00:01:36.154 --> 00:01:38.445
Audits help repair the programs that write it.
